{"chunk_id": "contract_policy#第三条", "doc_id": "contract_policy", "doc_title": "合同付款管理办法", "doc_type": "regulation", "clause_no": "第三条", "priority": 10, "version": "v3", "effective_from": "2024-01-01", "effective_to": null, "deprecated": false, "classes": ["http://ontorag.local/contract#PaymentApplication", "http://ontorag.local/contract#Contract"], "properties": ["http://ontorag.local/contract#paymentAmount", "http://ontorag.local/contract#contractAmount", "http://ontorag.local/contract#retentionRate", "http://ontorag.local/contract#paidAmount"], "text": "第三条 付款申请金额不得超过合同剩余应付金额，严禁超付。剩余应付金额按合同金额扣除质保金及累计已付金额计算：剩余应付 = 合同金额 ×（1 - 质保金比例）- 已付金额。付款申请金额超出剩余应付的，财务不得受理，须由业务部门核减金额或补充合同变更后重新提交。", "tenant_id": "demo"}
{"chunk_id": "contract_policy#第四条", "doc_id": "contract_policy", "doc_title": "合同付款管理办法", "doc_type": "regulation", "clause_no": "第四条", "priority": 10, "version": "v3", "effective_from": "2024-01-01", "effective_to": null, "deprecated": false, "classes": ["http://ontorag.local/contract#Invoice", "http://ontorag.local/contract#PaymentApplication"], "properties": ["http://ontorag.local/contract#invoiceAmount", "http://ontorag.local/contract#paymentAmount"], "text": "第四条 付款申请关联发票的合计金额不得超过本次付款申请金额。发票金额合计超过付款金额的，属于合同-发票-付款链路不一致，须退回业务部门补正；同一张发票不得重复关联多笔付款申请。", "tenant_id": "demo"}
{"chunk_id": "contract_policy#第七条", "doc_id": "contract_policy", "doc_title": "合同付款管理办法", "doc_type": "regulation", "clause_no": "第七条", "priority": 10, "version": "v3", "effective_from": "2024-01-01", "effective_to": null, "deprecated": false, "classes": ["http://ontorag.local/contract#Contract", "http://ontorag.local/contract#PaymentApplication"], "properties": ["http://ontorag.local/contract#contractStatus", "http://ontorag.local/contract#paymentAmount"], "text": "第七条 合同状态为已关闭或已终止的，不得再发起付款申请。已关闭合同如确需付款，须先完成合同变更或补充协议，将状态恢复为履行中，方可提交付款申请。", "tenant_id": "demo"}
{"chunk_id": "carbon_standard#5.2", "doc_id": "carbon_standard", "doc_title": "企业温室气体排放核算与报告规范", "doc_type": "standard", "clause_no": "5.2", "priority": 30, "version": "v1", "effective_from": "2023-06-01", "effective_to": null, "deprecated": false, "classes": ["http://ontorag.local/carbon#EmissionRecord", "http://ontorag.local/carbon#EmissionFactor"], "properties": ["http://ontorag.local/carbon#emissionAmount", "http://ontorag.local/carbon#activityData", "http://ontorag.local/carbon#factorValue", "http://ontorag.local/carbon#gwp"], "text": "5.2 排放量核算。排放量（tCO2e）= 活动数据 × 排放因子 × 全球增温潜势（GWP）。活动数据应取自计量器具记录或采购凭证；排放因子应优先采用国家主管部门发布的缺省值，并注明来源年份。核算结果保留两位小数，四舍五入。", "tenant_id": "demo"}
{"chunk_id": "carbon_standard#5.4", "doc_id": "carbon_standard", "doc_title": "企业温室气体排放核算与报告规范", "doc_type": "standard", "clause_no": "5.4", "priority": 30, "version": "v1", "effective_from": "2023-06-01", "effective_to": null, "deprecated": false, "classes": ["http://ontorag.local/carbon#AccountingBoundary", "http://ontorag.local/carbon#EmissionSource"], "properties": ["http://ontorag.local/carbon#exclusivityGroup", "http://ontorag.local/carbon#boundaryApproach"], "text": "5.4 核算边界。企业应明确采用运营控制、财务控制或股权比例法之一作为合并方式，并在报告中披露。同一排放源在同一互斥组内只能归属一个核算边界，不得同时计入两个边界，避免重复计算。", "tenant_id": "demo"}
{"chunk_id": "legacy_policy#第二条", "doc_id": "legacy_policy", "doc_title": "旧版付款审批流程（已废止）", "doc_type": "archive", "clause_no": "第二条", "priority": 40, "version": "v1", "effective_from": "2019-01-01", "effective_to": "2022-12-31", "deprecated": true, "classes": ["http://ontorag.local/contract#PaymentApplication"], "properties": ["http://ontorag.local/contract#paymentAmount"], "text": "第二条 付款申请经部门负责人审批后即可付款，无需校验合同剩余应付金额。本流程自 2023 年起废止。", "tenant_id": "demo"}
{"chunk_id": "contract_policy#旧版说明", "doc_id": "contract_policy", "doc_title": "合同付款管理办法（2023 版）", "doc_type": "archive", "clause_no": "附则", "priority": 40, "version": "v2", "effective_from": "2023-01-01", "effective_to": "2023-12-31", "deprecated": false, "classes": ["http://ontorag.local/contract#Contract"], "properties": ["http://ontorag.local/contract#contractAmount"], "text": "附则 本办法自 2023 年 1 月 1 日起施行，有效期一年。付款审批权限按金额分级授权。", "tenant_id": "demo"}
